# Portability patches (format and list: docs/UPSTREAM_CHANGES.md).
patch: joltik-neq-pad-offset
why: joltik_aead_decrypt computed Pad+c_len-8*i with Pad a uint8_t[8]: left to right that forms the pointer Pad+c_len,
why: which UBSan reports as 'index N out of bounds for uint8_t[8]' (joltik.c, CI run 45581879065), before subtracting back.
why: The patch parenthesises the offset, Pad+(c_len-8*i); the offset is the partial block length (1..7), the destination byte is identical and output is unchanged.
file: upstream/ref/joltik.c
count: 1
find:         memset(Pad+c_len-8*i, 0, 8-(c_len-8*i));
replace:         memset(Pad+(c_len-8*i), 0, 8-(c_len-8*i));
